WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:57.809
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:58.079 --> 02:00.799
We can see over a dozen police officers

3
02:00.799 --> 02:03.200
charging in armed with heavy weapons.

4
02:03.439 --> 02:05.239
We believe these criminals

5
02:05.239 --> 02:06.959
will definitely be rounded up.

6
02:21.759 --> 02:23.360
Currently, both robbers

7
02:23.360 --> 02:25.560
have been apprehended by our officers.

8
02:25.919 --> 02:28.159
In today's police operation,

9
02:28.159 --> 02:30.560
we not only rounded up all the criminals,

10
02:35.639 --> 02:39.159
but also ensured the safety of the citizens present.

11
02:39.439 --> 02:40.680
Throughout the entire incident,

12
02:40.680 --> 02:43.479
not a single citizen was harmed.

13
02:55.800 --> 02:58.039
I've never seen an operation this crazy.

14
02:58.400 --> 03:00.240
You think your guy is Iron Man?

15
03:00.719 --> 03:02.360
He's even tougher than Iron Man.

16
03:14.400 --> 03:15.199
Next.

17
03:21.560 --> 03:22.479
What's your name?

18
03:22.960 --> 03:23.520
Zhuang Cen.

19
03:26.400 --> 03:28.000
You're that Chinese guy.

20
03:28.400 --> 03:28.719
Yes.

21
03:30.080 --> 03:33.639
Impressive. Daring to steal from the Four Families.

22
03:38.039 --> 03:39.080
What's your name?

23
04:19.560 --> 04:21.279
My husband is a law-abiding citizen.

24
04:21.279 --> 04:22.279
He can't be a robber.

25
04:22.480 --> 04:23.519
Release him immediately!

26
04:23.680 --> 04:24.720
Your husband was

27
04:24.720 --> 04:25.759
robbing a drug shipment at gunpoint

28
04:25.759 --> 04:27.160
when he was caught red-handed.

29
04:27.240 --> 04:28.920
There's no way he's a robber!

30
04:29.360 --> 04:30.360
I need to see him right now.

31
04:30.560 --> 04:31.959
He committed a severe felony.

32
04:32.360 --> 04:33.680
No one is allowed to see him right now.

33
04:33.920 --> 04:34.959
We are Chinese citizens.

34
04:35.279 --> 04:36.319
I know my rights.

35
04:36.439 --> 04:37.920
If you insist on keeping me from him,

36
04:37.920 --> 04:39.519
I will call the Chinese Consulate right now.

37
04:39.759 --> 04:40.800
This is Country M,

38
04:40.839 --> 04:42.480
not your home country.

39
04:42.480 --> 04:44.240
I told you, I must see him now!

40
04:45.639 --> 04:46.639
Let me tell you one more time.

41
04:46.959 --> 04:48.439
Your husband committed a major felony.

42
04:48.519 --> 04:49.680
Not only do we have the right to detain him,

43
04:49.720 --> 04:51.199
we can also investigate anyone connected to him.

44
04:51.240 --> 04:53.199
If you keep interfering with my work,

45
04:53.279 --> 04:54.279
I will suspect that you

46
04:54.279 --> 04:56.759
were involved in your husband's crime.

47
04:56.800 --> 04:58.120
I'm giving you one chance.

48
04:58.199 --> 04:59.560
If you don't leave right now,

49
04:59.720 --> 05:00.800
I will arrest you.

50
05:02.040 --> 05:02.920
You'll regret this.

51
05:09.879 --> 05:12.240
I didn't expect those guys to move early.

52
05:13.480 --> 05:14.519
Good thing Zhuang Yan is okay.

53
05:15.319 --> 05:17.519
Everything is still under our control.

54
05:19.639 --> 05:21.560
Are you sure everything is under control?

55
05:23.519 --> 05:25.160
Zhuang Yan is risking his life right now.

56
05:25.759 --> 05:27.439
I don't even have a chance to meet him.

57
05:27.439 --> 05:29.000
How are we supposed to launch the next move?

58
05:31.399 --> 05:34.199
I'll find a way for you two to meet in a couple of days.

59
05:34.360 --> 05:36.759
Your visit to the police station today was part of the act.

60
05:36.920 --> 05:38.240
Once Zhuang Yan gets close to Ma Jingrong,

61
05:38.240 --> 05:39.839
meeting him will actually make sense.

62
05:40.279 --> 05:41.560
Since this is an undercover operation,

63
05:41.759 --> 05:43.319
and a joint effort with Country M's police,

64
05:43.319 --> 05:44.279
why make Zhuang Yan take

65
05:44.279 --> 05:45.399
such a massive risk all by himself?

66
05:46.800 --> 05:48.680
Piyazi and Thirade

67
05:48.680 --> 05:49.879
definitely have moles inside the police.

68
05:50.120 --> 05:51.279
We have to make the act look real.

69
05:51.279 --> 05:52.720
That's the only way to fool their informants.

70
05:53.079 --> 05:54.399
Zhuang Yan and I have an agreement.

71
05:54.879 --> 05:55.600
One week.

72
05:56.480 --> 05:57.319
Within one week,

73
05:57.480 --> 05:58.800
if he can't get close to Ma Jingrong,

74
05:59.319 --> 06:00.720
I'll request to call off this mission

75
06:00.959 --> 06:02.240
and pull him out through official channels.

76
06:02.639 --> 06:03.600
One week.

77
06:03.639 --> 06:04.079
Yes.

78
06:05.000 --> 06:06.360
Are you sure that within a week,

79
06:06.360 --> 06:07.800
he won't be in any danger in there?

80
07:11.759 --> 07:13.240
The drug ring we busted earlier...

81
07:13.240 --> 07:14.759
...was led by Zhao Jianfeng.

82
07:15.800 --> 07:17.439
Based on his confession

83
07:17.439 --> 07:19.680
and the evidence collected at the scene,

84
07:20.279 --> 07:21.480
we can now confirm that

85
07:21.639 --> 07:22.439
his direct supplier

86
07:22.800 --> 07:25.319
is Zhang Xuebin, founder of Chaoqing Online Shop.

87
07:26.560 --> 07:28.160
Chaoqing Online Shop and Yike Gifts

88
07:28.160 --> 07:29.639
have always been under our suspicion.

89
07:30.319 --> 07:32.399
Their managers are likely just like Qian Feng,

90
07:34.079 --> 07:35.519
all acting under Chen Hai's orders.

91
07:35.680 --> 07:38.120
However, our suspicion of Chen Hai

92
07:38.319 --> 07:39.600
is currently merely a deduction.

93
07:39.759 --> 07:41.720
We lack solid evidence to back it up,

94
07:42.639 --> 07:44.279
so we can't arrest Chen Hai just yet.

95
07:45.319 --> 07:46.560
Arrest the heads of Chaoqing Online Shop

96
07:46.560 --> 07:47.759
and Yike Gifts,

97
07:47.759 --> 07:49.000
Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying,

98
07:49.279 --> 07:50.600
to see if we can obtain

99
07:51.240 --> 07:52.839
any evidence linking Chen Hai through them.

100
07:54.279 --> 07:54.839
Also,

101
07:55.680 --> 07:56.680
what's the update on Hu Dong?

102
07:56.800 --> 07:57.759
Any new leads?

103
07:59.000 --> 08:00.439
According to Zhao Jianfeng's statement,

104
08:01.879 --> 08:04.199
Hu Dong had been getting money from him.

105
08:04.399 --> 08:06.160
However, relying solely on his confession,

106
08:06.319 --> 08:07.920
I don't think it's enough to prove

107
08:08.199 --> 08:09.959
the relationship between Chen Hai and Hu Dong.

108
08:10.480 --> 08:13.319
If Chen Hai's subordinates fall one after another,

109
08:13.480 --> 08:14.639
he'll definitely get anxious.

110
08:15.560 --> 08:17.680
He will certainly use Hu Dong to handle a lot of things.

111
08:19.000 --> 08:19.680
Keep a close watch on Hu Dong,

112
08:20.240 --> 08:21.800
and we'll definitely find linking evidence.

113
08:23.079 --> 08:23.519
Captain Bai.

114
08:24.199 --> 08:25.600
The Criminal Investigation team called to say

115
08:25.600 --> 08:27.120
a female body was found on the outskirts.

116
08:27.199 --> 08:28.360
The deceased showed signs of drug use

117
08:28.360 --> 08:30.199
or being forcibly injected with narcotics.

118
08:30.680 --> 08:32.080
Captain Shen asked us to send someone over to check.

119
08:36.440 --> 08:36.879
Captain Bai.

120
08:38.200 --> 08:38.919
Here's the situation.

121
08:40.120 --> 08:40.919
Tian Xin has gone missing.

122
08:42.000 --> 08:43.080
I checked both her store and her home,

123
08:43.080 --> 08:44.039
but couldn't find her anywhere.

124
08:44.320 --> 08:45.559
I feel that the last phone call

125
08:45.559 --> 08:46.519
we had two days ago

126
08:47.679 --> 08:48.320
seemed suspicious.

127
08:52.960 --> 08:53.759
Go check it out first.

128
09:04.000 --> 09:05.559
We originally came here to fish,

129
09:06.159 --> 09:07.720
but from a distance we saw someone

130
09:07.720 --> 09:08.360
lying face down over there.

131
09:08.559 --> 09:10.200
We didn't know if they were dead or alive.

132
09:11.159 --> 09:12.759
When we walked up closer,

133
09:13.240 --> 09:14.039
it scared the hell out of us.

134
09:14.399 --> 09:15.440
Yeah, it was horrifying.

135
09:15.759 --> 09:17.000
So we called the police right away.

136
09:20.639 --> 09:21.240
Li Xiao.

137
09:30.960 --> 09:32.080
Alright, go on.

138
09:32.480 --> 09:33.000
Go ahead.

139
09:36.360 --> 09:37.159
I'm heading in then.

140
09:37.399 --> 09:37.759
Go on.

141
09:41.759 --> 09:42.679
Don't forget at noon,

142
09:43.320 --> 09:44.519
to eat at my uncle's place.

143
09:44.759 --> 09:45.799
I'll pick you up when I'm done.

144
09:46.399 --> 09:46.840
No need.

145
09:46.840 --> 09:48.120
I can go myself after the examination.

146
09:48.639 --> 09:49.559
Once the autopsy report is out,

147
09:49.559 --> 09:50.799
notify Captain Lu and me right away.

148
09:51.600 --> 09:52.360
Where are you going?

149
10:19.279 --> 10:19.759
Hello.

150
10:21.519 --> 10:21.919
Police.

151
10:22.320 --> 10:23.159
Excuse me,

152
10:23.320 --> 10:23.840
two days ago,

153
10:24.519 --> 10:26.039
did a woman named Tian Xin

154
10:26.039 --> 10:27.080
have a visit on record?

155
10:27.559 --> 10:28.200
Tian Xin.

156
10:28.200 --> 10:28.639
Tian Xin...

157
10:28.960 --> 10:29.360
One moment.

158
10:32.840 --> 10:34.159
I found Tian Xin's record.

159
10:34.559 --> 10:36.840
She had three tests done at our hospital.

160
10:37.000 --> 10:39.360
The last one was a pelvic MRI.

161
10:40.279 --> 10:41.480
The system shows that

162
10:41.879 --> 10:44.519
at 11:37 a.m. two days ago,

163
10:44.679 --> 10:46.080
the hospital had issued her report,

164
10:46.600 --> 10:48.679
and it shows she already picked it up.

165
10:50.080 --> 10:51.159
11:37?

166
10:51.399 --> 10:52.679
Yes, 11:37.

167
10:54.399 --> 10:55.320
All right, thank you.

168
11:16.679 --> 11:17.519
Please rewind that.

169
11:22.519 --> 11:22.960
Pause.

170
11:25.240 --> 11:26.320
Play it in slow motion from here.

171
11:33.279 --> 11:33.759
Stop.

172
11:37.519 --> 11:37.960
Zoom in.

173
11:58.519 --> 12:00.759
Li Qiang is very adept at counter-surveillance.

174
12:01.720 --> 12:04.600
He must know exactly where the cameras are.

175
12:06.240 --> 12:06.799
Exactly.

176
12:07.279 --> 12:08.279
The way I see it,

177
12:08.480 --> 12:09.600
he got caught on camera on purpose.

178
12:12.080 --> 12:12.720
Li Qiang knew

179
12:13.720 --> 12:16.279
Li Xiao would investigate the places

180
12:16.279 --> 12:17.559
Tian Xin visited before she vanished.

181
12:17.879 --> 12:18.679
By doing this,

182
12:19.440 --> 12:20.320
he's deliberately taunting us.

183
12:20.720 --> 12:22.919
Before he died,

184
12:23.159 --> 12:24.639
Xu Duoduo mentioned Tian Xin to Ge Dan.

185
12:25.320 --> 12:26.240
Looking back now,

186
12:26.879 --> 12:28.120
he was trying to warn us

187
12:28.639 --> 12:29.919
that Tian Xin was in danger.

188
12:31.720 --> 12:32.799
Yet we all overlooked it.

189
12:35.080 --> 12:35.639
Where are you going?

190
12:36.519 --> 12:37.440
Where are you going?

191
12:37.440 --> 12:37.840
To find her.

192
12:38.519 --> 12:39.080
Get back here!

193
12:39.600 --> 12:41.279
You have no idea where Li Qiang is right now.

194
12:41.320 --> 12:43.120
What good is rushing out blindly like this?

195
12:43.559 --> 12:44.240
Then what should I do?

196
12:44.840 --> 12:45.759
Just sit here like an idiot?

197
12:45.879 --> 12:47.600
Li Qiang just wants to rattle you,

198
12:48.200 --> 12:49.799
and it seems he's succeeded.

199
12:50.600 --> 12:51.879
Li Xiao, don't lose your head!

200
12:52.039 --> 12:53.000
With so many of us here,

201
12:53.200 --> 12:54.159
how could none of us realize

202
12:54.159 --> 12:55.320
Li Qiang would go after Tian Xin?

203
12:55.480 --> 12:56.960
All we do is work cases

204
12:57.360 --> 12:58.120
and make arrests.

205
12:58.679 --> 12:59.480
But when it really matters,

206
12:59.480 --> 13:00.399
we can't even protect

207
13:00.399 --> 13:01.320
the people closest to us!

208
13:01.399 --> 13:02.600
What kind of cops are we?

209
13:03.000 --> 13:04.399
What kind of cops are we?

210
13:04.600 --> 13:05.919
What kind of cops are we?!

211
13:09.600 --> 13:10.399
Out of my way!

212
13:11.919 --> 13:12.399
Let him go.

213
13:19.240 --> 13:20.039
Stop right there.

214
13:21.200 --> 13:22.440
Leave your gun behind.

215
13:27.879 --> 13:28.600
You've lost.

216
13:31.320 --> 13:32.279
Psychologically,

217
13:34.240 --> 13:35.879
you've already lost to Li Qiang.

218
13:47.679 --> 13:49.039
He wouldn't really go look for Li Qiang, would he?

219
13:53.559 --> 13:54.159
No, he wouldn't.

220
14:56.279 --> 14:57.039
Done venting?

221
14:59.759 --> 15:00.399
Calmed down?

222
15:09.799 --> 15:10.919
Just like you,

223
15:12.879 --> 15:15.360
we know the only way to save Tian Xin right now

224
15:15.559 --> 15:16.679
is to catch Li Qiang.

225
15:18.519 --> 15:19.480
And I believe

226
15:20.360 --> 15:23.200
Tian Xin is pinning all her hopes

227
15:23.320 --> 15:24.759
on you right now.

228
15:27.919 --> 15:29.120
If you don't want to let her down,

229
15:29.360 --> 15:30.000
take a shower,

230
15:30.600 --> 15:31.720
clean yourself up,

231
15:32.039 --> 15:33.200
and come back to the team for the briefing.

232
15:41.840 --> 15:43.480
You reek of sweat.

233
15:59.320 --> 16:00.559
As long as Xiaokang is around,

234
16:01.360 --> 16:03.000
our deal won't go through.

235
16:07.279 --> 16:08.879
I want you to make your move tonight.

236
16:22.480 --> 16:23.080
What's wrong?

237
16:23.879 --> 16:24.919
You've been on edge these past two days.

238
16:26.240 --> 16:27.759
Nothing. Just a little tired.

239
16:29.159 --> 16:30.759
You haven't left my place in two days,

240
16:31.000 --> 16:32.039
lying in bed the whole time.

241
16:32.679 --> 16:33.720
How could that wear you out?

242
16:34.399 --> 16:34.960
By the way,

243
16:35.799 --> 16:37.240
you've skipped work for two days.

244
16:37.440 --> 16:38.679
Won't your boss say something?

245
16:38.960 --> 16:40.200
What if he docks your pay?

246
16:41.480 --> 16:42.679
Can we not talk about money?

247
16:42.960 --> 16:44.320
I'll be lucky just to stay alive right now.

248
16:45.360 --> 16:46.559
What on earth did you do?

249
16:50.039 --> 16:52.360
Didn't you say you worked at Black Panther Club?

250
16:53.919 --> 16:56.480
Have you been lying to me this whole time?

251
16:58.960 --> 16:59.919
What am I doing?

252
17:00.519 --> 17:01.919
Do you even care what I'm doing?

253
17:03.799 --> 17:04.839
Would working at Black Panther Club

254
17:04.880 --> 17:06.640
deck you out in gold and silver,

255
17:06.640 --> 17:07.960
and get you this LV bag?

256
17:08.799 --> 17:09.400
Do you have any idea?

257
17:10.039 --> 17:11.720
I hang out with drug dealers every day!

258
17:12.000 --> 17:13.640
To make money, I even stole from the boss!

259
17:13.680 --> 17:14.680
What more do you want from me?

260
17:15.759 --> 17:16.680
Drug dealers?

261
17:17.680 --> 17:18.440
The boss?

262
17:19.200 --> 17:20.640
What did you actually do?

263
17:21.359 --> 17:23.039
A couple days ago, the boss sent me to collect cash,

264
17:23.480 --> 17:24.440
and we ran straight into the cops.

265
17:25.440 --> 17:26.640
I ditched the guys and ran.

266
17:27.160 --> 17:28.200
Right now, the boss is probably

267
17:28.759 --> 17:30.240
sending men everywhere to hunt me down.

268
17:38.839 --> 17:39.119
Brother Kai!

269
17:39.960 --> 17:40.279
Brother Kai!

270
17:40.400 --> 17:41.440
Spare me! Spare me, please!

271
17:41.519 --> 17:42.279
Why are you running?

272
17:42.599 --> 17:43.640
I'm not running, I'm not running!

273
17:44.240 --> 17:45.599
Brother Biao just misses you a lot.

274
17:45.799 --> 17:46.559
Come back with us.

275
17:47.640 --> 17:48.440
You'll be fine.

276
17:52.519 --> 17:54.000
Brother Kai, Da Na, Brother Wei...

277
17:54.000 --> 17:54.480
I was wrong.

278
17:54.480 --> 17:55.640
Please let me go, okay?

279
17:55.640 --> 17:56.640
If I go back with you,

280
17:56.640 --> 17:58.039
I'm a dead man.

281
17:58.039 --> 17:58.480
I messed up.

282
17:58.480 --> 17:59.799
If we wanted you dead, you'd be dead already.

283
18:00.119 --> 18:01.240
The boss is furious right now.

284
18:01.599 --> 18:03.920
Go back right now and explain it to Brother Biao.

285
18:04.200 --> 18:05.640
Hiding out like this won't solve anything.

286
18:05.839 --> 18:08.000
No, Brother Kai, listen to me...

287
18:08.599 --> 18:09.160
I—

288
18:11.079 --> 18:12.079
Brother Wei...

289
18:12.400 --> 18:12.960
Xiao Kang.

290
18:13.200 --> 18:13.759
Shut up.

291
18:15.000 --> 18:15.720
Keep your mouth shut,

292
18:16.880 --> 18:17.960
or I'll kill you.

293
18:33.799 --> 18:34.279
Captain.

294
18:35.400 --> 18:37.200
The autopsy report on the unidentified woman is in.

295
18:37.759 --> 18:38.599
The cause of death

296
18:38.599 --> 18:40.519
was a forced injection of a massive dose of drugs.

297
18:40.759 --> 18:42.319
Based on how long the body was submerged

298
18:42.559 --> 18:44.240
and the biological samples found on her,

299
18:44.440 --> 18:46.200
she likely entered the water at Dongshan Park.

300
18:46.440 --> 18:47.839
The detectives have already headed over.

301
18:49.839 --> 18:50.359
Let's go.

302
18:52.759 --> 18:53.599
Captain Bai, I'm coming too.

303
19:02.839 --> 19:03.440
There are fish by the river.

304
19:03.960 --> 19:05.279
You might have to catch one.

305
19:05.599 --> 19:06.039
You got it.

306
19:07.559 --> 19:08.200
Let's move.

307
19:20.799 --> 19:21.359
Brother Wei.

308
19:22.200 --> 19:23.519
Aren't we heading to the club?

309
19:27.759 --> 19:30.920
Brother Biao said the cops might be watching it.

310
19:31.480 --> 19:33.160
He told us to meet him somewhere else.

311
19:34.240 --> 19:35.680
So where are we going?

312
19:36.359 --> 19:37.720
What's your rush?

313
19:38.240 --> 19:38.880
What?

314
19:39.359 --> 19:40.279
Miss Brother Biao already?

315
19:43.079 --> 19:44.599
After the mess collecting the cash last time,

316
19:44.880 --> 19:45.799
the rest of us

317
19:45.799 --> 19:48.440
have been walking on eggshells around him.

318
19:49.559 --> 19:50.400
Good for you, though.

319
19:50.960 --> 19:53.079
Living it up in comfort,

320
19:53.279 --> 19:54.680
completely forgetting about us.

321
19:55.440 --> 19:57.079
No, no, not at all.

322
19:59.279 --> 20:00.279
What's wrong with you?

323
20:01.319 --> 20:02.359
You look terrible.

324
21:32.640 --> 21:33.319
Where is Brother Biao?

325
21:34.000 --> 21:34.680
Brother Biao!

326
21:36.359 --> 21:36.759
Come on.

327
21:39.279 --> 21:39.720
Come on.

328
21:43.279 --> 21:44.079
Brother Biao said

329
21:45.000 --> 21:46.160
he doesn't want to see you again.

330
21:48.440 --> 21:49.119
I was wrong.

331
21:49.440 --> 21:50.279
I was wrong, bro.

332
21:50.920 --> 21:52.559
The cops were right on me that day.

333
21:52.559 --> 21:53.960
I had no choice.

334
21:57.119 --> 21:57.640
Don't kill me.

335
21:58.200 --> 21:59.160
Don't kill me, I was wrong!

336
21:59.160 --> 22:00.160
I shouldn't have stolen the money.

337
22:00.160 --> 22:00.720
I was wrong, I was wrong!

338
22:00.720 --> 22:02.039
Don't kill me! Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

339
22:02.200 --> 22:03.440
Xiao Kang might not be a mole.

340
22:03.759 --> 22:04.839
He went to Brother Biao's room

341
22:05.240 --> 22:06.559
just to get some cash.

342
22:08.000 --> 22:09.359
Brother Biao was just worried you'd go soft,

343
22:10.160 --> 22:11.519
so he sent us to help you out.

344
22:12.759 --> 22:13.640
I'm not a mole!

345
22:13.640 --> 22:14.400
I'm not a mole!

346
22:14.559 --> 22:15.599
If Brother Biao says you're a mole,

347
22:15.759 --> 22:16.400
then you're a mole.

348
22:16.400 --> 22:17.319
I'm not! I'm not!

349
22:19.839 --> 22:21.599
Still saying you're not a cop?

350
22:24.279 --> 22:24.680
Goodbye.

351
22:30.880 --> 22:31.400
Let's go.

352
22:43.799 --> 22:45.640
Brother Kai, gotta hand it to you.

353
22:46.440 --> 22:47.119
That was impressive.

354
22:48.200 --> 22:48.960
Ruthless as hell.

355
22:50.079 --> 22:51.720
I thought you didn't believe he was an undercover.

356
22:51.960 --> 22:53.319
I didn't want to doubt my own brother.

357
22:53.839 --> 22:54.960
But if Xiaokang didn't die,

358
22:55.119 --> 22:56.599
we'd all be in danger.

359
22:56.960 --> 22:57.480
By the way,

360
22:58.240 --> 22:59.839
Xiaokang's girlfriend saw us today.

361
23:00.480 --> 23:01.839
Should we take her out as well?

362
23:03.319 --> 23:05.519
She was only with Xiaokang to scam some cash.

363
23:05.519 --> 23:06.920
She won't go looking for trouble.

364
23:09.599 --> 23:10.039
Let's go.

365
23:30.079 --> 23:30.519
Don't move.

366
23:35.319 --> 23:35.799
Don't move.

367
23:36.119 --> 23:36.799
We're here to save you.

368
23:40.720 --> 23:41.960
I told you to make it look like an accident,

369
23:41.960 --> 23:43.519
not shoot him dead!

370
23:48.400 --> 23:49.599
We didn't plan on shooting him.

371
23:50.039 --> 23:50.920
But who knew?

372
23:51.039 --> 23:52.240
He tipped off the police beforehand.

373
23:53.240 --> 23:55.039
Can't you use your head for once?

374
23:55.519 --> 23:56.920
Use your damn head!

375
23:57.119 --> 23:58.359
Whether it looks accidental really doesn't matter.

376
23:58.839 --> 23:59.920
The police have no evidence.

377
24:00.119 --> 24:01.119
They can't touch us.

378
24:01.839 --> 24:03.319
Besides, Xiaokang owed money

379
24:03.319 --> 24:04.480
to plenty of loan sharks.

380
24:05.039 --> 24:07.079
The cops will follow that lead.

381
24:09.640 --> 24:10.240
Are you sure?

382
24:11.279 --> 24:12.839
Dead men don't talk.

383
24:15.319 --> 24:17.960
Still, Xiaokang used to work for us,

384
24:18.599 --> 24:19.880
so the police will definitely show up.

385
24:20.119 --> 24:21.559
When that time comes, it'll depend on

386
24:21.599 --> 24:23.279
whether we can hold up under questioning.

387
24:28.880 --> 24:30.559
Get out, both of you.

388
24:37.599 --> 24:38.480
Can we trust these two?

389
24:39.079 --> 24:39.599
They're trustworthy.

390
24:40.400 --> 24:41.759
They were part of killing Xiaokang.

391
24:41.920 --> 24:43.480
That's not what I mean.

392
24:43.759 --> 24:44.880
I'm talking about when the cops arrive.

393
24:44.880 --> 24:46.599
What if these cowards rat us out?

394
24:46.759 --> 24:48.200
Then we have to prepare for the worst.

395
24:48.720 --> 24:50.000
If the police push too hard,

396
24:50.440 --> 24:51.359
we'll have to go on the run.

397
24:51.559 --> 24:52.359
Go on the run?

398
24:53.359 --> 24:55.359
Going on the run is the last thing I want.

399
24:55.680 --> 24:56.359
Do you see all this?

400
24:56.359 --> 24:58.079
Everything here took half my life to build.

401
24:58.880 --> 25:00.279
And I'm just supposed to give it away?

402
25:03.519 --> 25:05.000
If you had handled this earlier,

403
25:05.000 --> 25:06.319
none of this would have happened.

404
25:12.559 --> 25:13.400
All right, all right, enough.

405
25:15.519 --> 25:16.640
I can't put all the blame on you.

406
25:19.240 --> 25:20.119
What did you say just now?

407
25:20.279 --> 25:20.799
About Xiao...

408
25:21.880 --> 25:23.880
That Xiaokang borrowed a lot from loan sharks.

409
25:24.559 --> 25:25.000
Right.

410
25:25.599 --> 25:26.720
Didn't you tell me to check on him?

411
25:26.960 --> 25:28.279
While Xiaokang was missing these past few days,

412
25:28.680 --> 25:29.839
lots of loan sharks were looking for him.

413
25:30.000 --> 25:31.920
So I leaked his home address.

414
25:32.319 --> 25:34.079
When the police find Xiaokang's place,

415
25:34.240 --> 25:36.039
they're sure to find plenty of clues

416
25:36.039 --> 25:36.799
left behind by debt collectors.

417
25:41.240 --> 25:41.839
Nicely done.

418
25:45.359 --> 25:45.720
Brother Biao,

419
25:47.279 --> 25:48.599
I actually think Xiaokang's death

420
25:48.599 --> 25:49.400
isn't the real problem.

421
25:50.119 --> 25:51.920
What worries me most right now is Li Qiang.

422
25:52.160 --> 25:53.839
He's wanted citywide.

423
25:54.039 --> 25:55.160
I'm afraid he'll drag us down.

424
25:55.839 --> 25:56.599
I think

425
25:57.839 --> 25:58.839
we either close the deal early,

426
25:59.319 --> 26:00.240
or we call it off entirely.

427
26:00.839 --> 26:02.079
We're only in this for the money.

428
26:02.240 --> 26:04.279
There's no point taking such a huge risk.

429
26:12.880 --> 26:13.599
You're right.

430
26:14.720 --> 26:16.079
I'll arrange the deal as soon as possible.

431
26:31.200 --> 26:32.480
You got pretty lucky, kid.

432
26:34.519 --> 26:34.960
Start talking.

433
26:36.880 --> 26:38.559
I just accidentally fell into the river.

434
26:38.839 --> 26:39.680
Come on,

435
26:42.359 --> 26:43.279
is that against the law, too?

436
26:55.680 --> 26:56.680
It was an accident.

437
26:58.079 --> 26:59.119
An accident?

438
27:05.519 --> 27:06.640
Then explain to me

439
27:08.200 --> 27:09.000
what this is all about.

440
27:17.440 --> 27:19.119
And you still say you're not a cop?

441
27:20.759 --> 27:21.160
Goodbye.

442
27:32.839 --> 27:34.720
The facts are right in front of you,

443
27:35.720 --> 27:37.039
and you're still trying to deny it?

444
27:38.240 --> 27:38.880
Speak.

445
27:45.440 --> 27:47.799
You saw Ah Kai pull the trigger with your own eyes?

446
27:48.160 --> 27:49.039
That's right, Boss.

447
27:49.559 --> 27:50.799
Right in front of me.

448
27:51.039 --> 27:52.160
Without batting an eye.

449
27:52.960 --> 27:53.880
Truly ruthless.

450
27:59.319 --> 28:00.920
Looks like Ah Kai is in the clear, then.

451
28:02.759 --> 28:03.319
Boss,

452
28:04.119 --> 28:05.599
are you still suspecting Brother Kai?

453
28:30.400 --> 28:31.160
I just saw the photos.

454
28:31.160 --> 28:32.599
Your daughter really looks like you.

455
28:32.720 --> 28:33.839
Especially when she smiles.

456
28:35.559 --> 28:36.759
I just got back from the provincial department.

457
28:37.279 --> 28:38.920
I missed your case briefing.

458
28:39.680 --> 28:40.920
How did it go? All right?

459
28:42.119 --> 28:42.960
It's confirmed.

460
28:42.960 --> 28:45.799
The two bodies are Zhang Xuebin and Guo Yingying.

461
28:46.559 --> 28:48.200
I put Li Xiao in charge of this case.

462
28:49.519 --> 28:50.960
How's Li Xiao holding up?

463
28:52.160 --> 28:53.079
I suggested to him

464
28:53.079 --> 28:54.279
that he take some time off,

465
28:54.680 --> 28:55.480
but he refused.

466
28:55.759 --> 28:56.920
I think he'll be fine.

467
28:59.279 --> 29:01.160
We shouldn't just be busy cracking cases.

468
29:01.279 --> 29:03.799
We still need to look after our fellow officers.

469
29:04.519 --> 29:05.039
Understood.

470
29:07.519 --> 29:08.720
Ge Dan sent word.

471
29:09.079 --> 29:10.839
Zhuang Yan has entered Cyrano Prison,

472
29:10.880 --> 29:12.920
but apparently took massive risks.

473
29:13.599 --> 29:14.799
I'm really worried about him.

474
29:19.759 --> 29:22.400
Zhuang Yan is very adaptable.

475
29:22.519 --> 29:24.920
I'm confident he can pull off this mission.

476
29:26.039 --> 29:27.920
We need to speed up our operations here.

477
29:29.079 --> 29:29.440
By the way,

478
29:29.680 --> 29:31.319
Jiangyang police just notified us

479
29:31.559 --> 29:32.599
that an eyewitness

480
29:32.759 --> 29:34.400
spotted Cheng Weimin a few days ago.

481
29:35.000 --> 29:36.240
If we can capture him quickly,

482
29:36.319 --> 29:38.440
we can unmask Chen Hai in no time.

483
29:40.200 --> 29:42.880
As the drug supplier,

484
29:43.200 --> 29:45.279
he must have close ties to Zhongtian Logistics.

485
29:45.680 --> 29:46.960
Once he is captured,

486
29:47.440 --> 29:48.839
our investigation into Zhongtian Logistics

487
29:48.960 --> 29:50.200
can take a major step forward.

488
29:51.519 --> 29:52.160
Then let's get right on it.

489
29:52.400 --> 29:52.720
All right.

490
30:04.839 --> 30:06.160
The biggest guy over there

491
30:06.359 --> 30:07.039
is named Kano.

492
30:08.200 --> 30:09.839
He's a notorious thug in Cyrano.

493
30:10.680 --> 30:12.480
He's rotten to the core.

494
30:12.640 --> 30:13.599
I even heard

495
30:13.720 --> 30:16.000
he always picks on guys named Ma here.

496
30:25.519 --> 30:27.359
You could've escaped right away that day.

497
30:27.799 --> 30:29.000
Why did you come back?

498
30:30.480 --> 30:32.200
The robbery was moved up.

499
30:34.559 --> 30:35.839
I didn't want you in danger.

500
30:38.319 --> 30:38.799
Thanks.

501
30:40.200 --> 30:41.119
Forget it.

502
30:42.759 --> 30:45.519
I just didn't want my partner dying early.

503
30:49.400 --> 30:50.880
Chinese pig, bring the ball over!

504
30:56.200 --> 30:57.440
Have you ever heard the saying...

505
30:58.319 --> 31:00.759
"The enemy of my enemy is a friend"?

506
31:36.279 --> 31:36.880
Alright.

507
31:53.079 --> 31:55.160
Wait, wait, wait!

508
31:55.160 --> 31:56.559
They're just messing around!

509
31:56.880 --> 31:59.400
That Chinese guy is my friend.

510
31:59.400 --> 32:01.480
The Chinese guy and the big guy are friends.

511
32:02.039 --> 32:02.759
No, no, no.

512
32:03.079 --> 32:03.680
Officer, officer, officer!

513
32:03.920 --> 32:05.640
I'll give you money.

514
32:05.640 --> 32:06.960
I'll pay you!

515
32:06.960 --> 32:09.079
Go easy on that Chinese guy, okay?

516
32:09.160 --> 32:09.640
Sure.

517
32:16.359 --> 32:17.440
Put him in solitary.

518
32:17.519 --> 32:18.039
Take him away.

519
33:43.000 --> 33:44.759
The market price for No. 4 is a bit low.

520
33:45.319 --> 33:47.039
It's only up two points this month.

521
33:47.960 --> 33:49.400
Add in Psychedelic Blues,

522
33:50.400 --> 33:51.240
and our profit

523
33:51.240 --> 33:53.559
could actually grow by another five percent.

524
33:58.839 --> 33:59.920
Here in Jiechan State,

525
34:00.119 --> 34:02.519
we've been cracked down on by various militaries multiple times.

526
34:03.000 --> 34:04.599
Now everyone else is rising up.

527
34:06.440 --> 34:08.519
The Andes, known as the Silver Triangle,

528
34:08.599 --> 34:09.599
and the Amazon region...

529
34:10.199 --> 34:11.480
Their share of the global market

530
34:11.880 --> 34:13.480
is about to overtake Jiechan State.

531
34:14.599 --> 34:15.880
We can't just look at the short term.

532
34:16.239 --> 34:18.199
We must increase the purity of our product,

533
34:18.920 --> 34:19.880
especially No. 4.

534
34:20.400 --> 34:21.840
In the global market,

535
34:21.840 --> 34:23.239
we have to secure the top spot.

536
34:30.559 --> 34:31.039
Boss.

537
34:33.039 --> 34:34.519
Cloud Leopard brought Dr. Du Guangming in.

538
34:41.519 --> 34:42.559
Let go of me! You...

539
34:42.800 --> 34:43.960
What do you want?!

540
34:45.119 --> 34:46.199
What are you doing?!

541
34:47.039 --> 34:47.440
Let—

542
34:48.320 --> 34:49.280
Who are you people?

543
34:58.880 --> 34:59.719
What is this place?

544
35:00.519 --> 35:01.440
Who the hell are you?!

545
35:02.119 --> 35:02.880
What do you want?!

546
35:03.000 --> 35:03.960
No rush to speak.

547
35:04.519 --> 35:05.079
Have some water.

548
35:10.679 --> 35:11.599
Who are you people?

549
35:12.320 --> 35:13.559
Why did you kidnap me?

550
35:35.840 --> 35:36.400
Boss.

551
35:37.000 --> 35:38.280
Professor Du.

552
35:45.599 --> 35:46.840
What do you think you're doing?

553
35:47.079 --> 35:48.800
I told you to invite Professor Du here.

554
35:48.800 --> 35:49.800
What is this?

555
35:53.679 --> 35:55.159
What do you want?

556
35:55.159 --> 35:56.559
My apologies, Professor Du.

557
35:56.559 --> 35:57.280
Professor Du,

558
35:58.239 --> 35:59.039
forgive the rough reception.

559
36:10.199 --> 36:11.599
I'm just a teacher.

560
36:12.159 --> 36:13.599
What do you want with me?

561
36:15.320 --> 36:17.000
Hardly just a teacher.

562
36:17.000 --> 36:18.119
You're far too modest.

563
36:18.679 --> 36:20.840
You're a renowned figure.

564
36:23.679 --> 36:25.559
That journal...

565
36:25.880 --> 36:27.000
The international one, what's it called?

566
36:27.360 --> 36:29.079
Geochimica et Cosmochimica Acta.

567
36:29.079 --> 36:29.920
Right, right, right.

568
36:31.320 --> 36:33.199
Young and accomplished, Professor Du.

569
36:33.760 --> 36:35.599
You bring honor to all Chinese people.

570
36:40.320 --> 36:41.119
You didn't bring me here

571
36:42.639 --> 36:44.199
just to discuss academia, did you?

572
36:47.360 --> 36:50.039
Actually, I really did bring you here to talk science.

573
36:50.679 --> 36:52.760
We're ready to provide you with a platform

574
36:53.039 --> 36:55.760
where your talent can shine. What do you think?

575
36:58.639 --> 37:00.239
You want me to make drugs for you.

576
37:00.519 --> 37:01.039
Drugs?

577
37:01.519 --> 37:02.840
That's just a word.

578
37:03.119 --> 37:04.719
In the eyes of scholars like you,

579
37:04.719 --> 37:08.599
it's nothing more than a chemical compound.

580
37:10.719 --> 37:11.079
No.

581
37:12.000 --> 37:12.760
You've got it wrong.

582
37:13.440 --> 37:14.920
I'm just a researcher.

583
37:15.079 --> 37:16.159
I don't make drugs.

584
37:16.679 --> 37:18.480
Nobody's asking you to cook drugs.

585
37:18.719 --> 37:20.760
We have factories and workers.

586
37:21.159 --> 37:22.239
All you need to do

587
37:23.159 --> 37:24.320
is refine the formula

588
37:24.800 --> 37:27.159
and supervise the process.

589
37:27.519 --> 37:28.679
Just like in your lab.

590
37:28.679 --> 37:30.119
Easy as pie.

591
37:31.360 --> 37:32.039
No, no, no.

592
37:32.760 --> 37:33.599
You're mistaken.

593
37:34.639 --> 37:36.119
I won't do anything illegal.

594
37:36.679 --> 37:37.280
Illegal?

595
37:40.480 --> 37:41.519
This is Jiechan State.

596
37:41.519 --> 37:42.679
Is making drugs illegal here?

597
37:44.639 --> 37:45.719
All right, all right.

598
37:48.840 --> 37:49.639
What you're asking,

599
37:49.840 --> 37:50.880
I understand completely.

600
37:51.039 --> 37:51.519
But...

601
37:52.719 --> 37:54.480
let me tell you clearly:

602
37:56.480 --> 37:57.039
No way.

603
38:00.039 --> 38:02.320
Now, that doesn't make sense to me.

604
38:02.559 --> 38:03.920
We pay you,

605
38:03.920 --> 38:06.920
and let you do what you love doing.

606
38:07.719 --> 38:09.400
There's no reason to refuse.

607
38:10.840 --> 38:11.519
You're wrong.

608
38:12.519 --> 38:14.000
My chemical research

609
38:14.320 --> 38:16.360
is meant to advance human civilization.

610
38:16.480 --> 38:17.719
While what you're asking me to do...

611
38:17.800 --> 38:18.800
that's a crime!

612
38:19.440 --> 38:21.360
That's a desecration of conscience!

613
38:21.840 --> 38:22.800
Desecration?

614
38:24.320 --> 38:26.159
What are drugs, anyway?

615
38:27.079 --> 38:28.079
What defines a drug?

616
38:28.400 --> 38:29.880
If the government says it is, it is.

617
38:29.880 --> 38:31.599
If they say it isn't, it isn't.

618
38:31.679 --> 38:32.400
Heroin...

619
38:33.519 --> 38:34.719
is it a drug?

620
38:34.760 --> 38:35.800
Who invented it?

621
38:36.239 --> 38:37.960
Wasn't it chemists like you?

622
38:38.599 --> 38:39.000
No.

623
38:39.320 --> 38:39.800
No.

624
38:43.960 --> 38:44.800
Chemists...

625
38:45.320 --> 38:46.840
Chemists studied heroin

626
38:47.360 --> 38:48.079
to...

627
38:48.320 --> 38:48.960
to...

628
38:49.199 --> 38:51.199
to test its potential

629
38:51.199 --> 38:52.639
for medicinal use!

630
38:53.000 --> 38:53.760
Yet...

631
38:54.440 --> 38:57.599
you indulge and peddle narcotics!

632
38:57.719 --> 38:58.239
That...

633
38:58.679 --> 38:59.880
That goes against basic humanity!

634
39:00.199 --> 39:01.639
It goes against humanity!

635
39:02.159 --> 39:03.199
Humanity? I don't care about that.

636
39:03.280 --> 39:03.960
I only care about profit.

637
39:04.599 --> 39:05.480
As long as you work with me,

638
39:05.800 --> 39:06.679
I'll give you

639
39:06.800 --> 39:08.280
more than you could ever imagine.

640
39:08.719 --> 39:10.920
No, no, no.

641
39:11.119 --> 39:13.519
I don't care about wealth like that.

642
39:14.119 --> 39:16.360
I can't help you with this.

643
39:16.800 --> 39:17.639
I really can't help.

644
39:18.840 --> 39:19.480
Besides,

645
39:19.920 --> 39:21.000
I came to Country M

646
39:21.159 --> 39:22.559
for an academic exchange.

647
39:23.639 --> 39:24.760
Now that I'm missing,

648
39:25.320 --> 39:27.039
the police are surely searching everywhere for me.

649
39:28.360 --> 39:29.440
If I die here,

650
39:31.199 --> 39:33.920
you'll definitely become their target.

651
39:34.440 --> 39:35.440
So right now,

652
39:35.719 --> 39:37.039
your best choice is to let me go at once.

653
39:37.360 --> 39:39.679
I swear I won't mention you to anyone.

654
39:39.800 --> 39:40.280
I mean it.

655
39:42.400 --> 39:44.440
The police are after me?

656
39:45.280 --> 39:46.119
You know what?

657
39:47.360 --> 39:49.119
The military's been keeping tabs on me too.

658
39:49.320 --> 39:50.199
But I'm not afraid.

659
39:51.440 --> 39:53.440
This is Jiechan State.

660
39:53.639 --> 39:54.159
So what?

661
39:54.440 --> 39:55.760
Total anarchy, you understand?

662
39:57.880 --> 39:59.480
There's an old Chinese saying:

663
39:59.480 --> 40:01.079
"A wise man yields to circumstances."

664
40:01.679 --> 40:02.800
But why do I get the feeling, Professor Du,

665
40:02.800 --> 40:04.360
that you don't quite understand that?

666
40:05.880 --> 40:07.039
Aren't you afraid of dying right here?

667
40:16.880 --> 40:17.920
You can kill me,

668
40:18.239 --> 40:19.760
or you can choose to let me go.

669
40:21.639 --> 40:22.159
But...

670
40:23.400 --> 40:24.280
no matter what,

671
40:24.719 --> 40:26.679
I won't do anything for you.

672
40:29.199 --> 40:29.599
Never.

673
40:32.400 --> 40:33.519
Then that's too bad.

674
40:33.800 --> 40:34.599
You can go.

675
40:36.159 --> 40:36.840
What did you say?

676
40:37.159 --> 40:37.880
I said...

677
40:39.079 --> 40:41.400
if you choose not to cooperate with me,

678
40:42.679 --> 40:43.639
you can go.

679
40:44.039 --> 40:46.000
You can go.

680
41:19.239 --> 41:19.840
You...

681
41:22.320 --> 41:22.719
You...

682
41:36.800 --> 41:37.280
Boss.

683
41:39.760 --> 41:41.440
After Mr. Ma met Thirade and Jiang Liye,

684
41:41.519 --> 41:42.559
he was arrested by the police.

685
41:43.119 --> 41:43.920
He's in prison now.

686
41:44.320 --> 41:45.599
A narcotics bust?

687
41:46.239 --> 41:46.760
No.

688
41:47.199 --> 41:48.400
It was over a stolen national treasure.

689
41:48.840 --> 41:49.719
A national treasure?

690
41:51.440 --> 41:52.840
Still, now that the police have already

691
41:52.840 --> 41:53.480
locked him up,

692
41:53.679 --> 41:55.000
we won't need to do it ourselves.

693
41:57.400 --> 41:57.800
No.

694
41:59.400 --> 42:00.920
He knows too much about us.

695
42:01.920 --> 42:02.320
Take him out.

696
42:03.920 --> 42:04.320
Understood.

697
42:24.440 --> 42:24.960
You all right?

698
42:27.039 --> 42:27.760
Cen.

699
42:28.400 --> 42:29.679
Time in the hole...

700
42:30.239 --> 42:31.400
wasn't easy, was it?

701
42:34.800 --> 42:35.400
How are you holding up?

702
42:38.079 --> 42:39.079
Does it make any difference?

703
42:39.920 --> 42:42.239
Out here is just a bigger hole.

704
42:44.159 --> 42:44.679
Fine.

705
42:44.679 --> 42:46.079
If I'd known you were so tough,

706
42:46.800 --> 42:48.119
I wouldn't have bothered

707
42:48.119 --> 42:49.079
getting you out.

708
42:50.880 --> 42:51.800
You could've rotted in there forever

709
42:52.039 --> 42:52.440
for all I care.

710
42:54.360 --> 42:55.400
If I stay here,

711
42:56.800 --> 42:58.239
you'll never get out either.

712
43:02.559 --> 43:03.440
What's your problem?

713
43:03.960 --> 43:07.440
Aren't Chinese people all about repaying favors?

714
43:08.719 --> 43:10.360
I got you out,

715
43:10.519 --> 43:11.840
and not even a "thank you"?

716
43:12.559 --> 43:13.280
Some brother you are.

717
43:16.920 --> 43:17.519
Thank you.

718
43:17.880 --> 43:18.400
Happy now?

719
43:25.679 --> 43:27.840
I just figured, since we're both Chinese,

720
43:28.119 --> 43:29.400
I'd come say hello.

721
43:31.360 --> 43:33.000
Chinese, foreigner...

722
43:33.599 --> 43:34.880
What difference does it make here?

723
43:37.679 --> 43:39.000
The locals here...

724
43:39.639 --> 43:41.559
they look down on outsiders like us.

725
43:42.880 --> 43:45.039
The guy who fought you is named Kano.

726
43:45.719 --> 43:47.039
He's intensely jealous.

727
43:47.400 --> 43:48.320
Watch your back.

728
43:49.480 --> 43:50.800
You think he can beat me?

729
43:55.039 --> 43:55.960
What are you in for?

730
43:57.079 --> 43:58.039
None of your business.

731
44:00.599 --> 44:01.920
In a place like this,

732
44:02.880 --> 44:03.840
without any friends,

733
44:04.360 --> 44:05.599
staying alive...

734
44:06.599 --> 44:07.239
is tough.
